<XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x1003" flags="0x0">
  <title>Shift-schedule pedal source flags</title>
  <description>[CONFIRMED, TCM 02 §2] Bit 1 = 0 (stock): shift lines read throttle_b 3FB766 (from ECM CAN 0x23E b6); 1: read the accel pedal 3FB992 (0x23D b2). The factory shift speeds (FSM AT-62) match the lines at y = 128 (half) and 255 (full), so y is a 0-255 full-travel scale. Rescales every line if flipped.</description>
  <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="6" />
  <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x0" mmedaddress="0x60352" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
