  <description>[STRONG, TCM 03 §6, TCM 04 §1] Cut sent to the ECM in CAN 0x253 byte 3 = value/256 of engine torque, during the inertia phase. Rows: engine torque (0x23E raw, ~0.125 N·m/bit CANDIDATE), first row with key ≥ torque; columns: first rpm breakpoint ≥ rpm. Enabled per shift by 0x68E8E. Alternate set 0x6A2BC when 3FB187 bit 2. Shift index from table 0x4B1E0 [CONFIRMED].</description>
