<XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x11CF" flags="0x0">
  <title>Torque-cut extra apply ramp</title>
  <description>[CONFIRMED, TCM 06 §2] Extra apply-ramp step 3FB3DE added to 3FB502 every 20 ms with 3FB3D4 (FUN_25E9C/25E44): 3DE = min(K × 3FB510 / 1024, max step), 3FB510 = (engine torque 3FB310 − 3FB30E) × converter ratio 3FB312 / 1024. Gated by the torque-reduction request 3FB872 (CAN 0x253 b3): active once the cut has lasted more than col 0 ticks (3FB46A) and until col 1 ticks after it ends (3FB46C). Stock K = 0 for all four upshifts, so 3DE = 0 (CONFIRMED live). A higher K firms up the apply while the engine torque is being cut.</description>
  <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="5" />
  <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
