  <description>[STRONG, TCM 05 §2] Engaging-element pressure end target 3FB504 = max(a·|T_turbine|/1024 · gain/1024 + b·hold/1024 + offset, floor) (FUN_261A8); offset = captured pressure − (c·|T| + d·hold)/1024 so the target starts at the current pressure. a = the main firmness-vs-torque knob. Pedal released → floor only. Stock b = d = 0. Same pressure unit as the apply ramp (10000 = full).</description>
