<XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1224" flags="0x0">
  <title>Adaptive cell clamp 1→2</title>
  <description>[CONFIRMED, TCM 06 §3] Apply ramp used = base ramp 3FB3E0 × clamp(learned cell, min, max) / 256 (FUN_41CCC). Stock min = max = 256 for every shift and torque band, so the learned cells are ignored (CONFIRMED live: 3FB3D4 = 3FB3E0 in every logged upshift). Widening the range turns shift-time adaptation on.</description>
  <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="5" />
